    "procedure": "Regenerate all 56 exact source fixtures, run unchanged matching/baseline source beams, compare every archived score and recovery, independently count rune matches and rescore all paths.",
    "parameters": "Eight generator-and-plant pairs × seven seeds 3301–3307 × two decoders; 240 runes; width 400; sign -1; offset 0; suppression .83; paired skips or q=.05 / ten fixed drifts; median recovery gate .90.",
    "exclusions": "Manuscript sweep, wrong-key calibration, native runtime parity, nonzero-offset recovery, other lengths or languages and general cipher exclusion."
  },
